# The bundled Node runtime and the assembled desktop payload. Both are fetched
# or built, both are large, and both are pinned by digest in
# apps/desktop/runtime.json — so the repository records what they must be
# rather than carrying a copy of them.
apps/desktop/vendor/
apps/desktop/payload/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/
